{"5026760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms: Emergency Exit", "steam_appid": 5026760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Backrooms: Emergency Exit <strong>up to 4 players</strong> are trapped in the infamous Backrooms, based on the popular creepypasta. Traverse the levels of the Backrooms, each with their own set of secrets, quirks, and dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/a8a4535a8e45f2742a35f6ffad1fc176.poster.avif?t=1786921370\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/a8a4535a8e45f2742a35f6ffad1fc176.webm?t=1786921370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/a8a4535a8e45f2742a35f6ffad1fc176.mp4?t=1786921370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Horrifying Immersion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Backrooms in all its unsettling nature. <strong>Photorealistic Graphis, carefully designed Audio, and minimal interfaces</strong> will make you feel like you are truly lost in the Backrooms. The game combines elements of both classic horror and liminal spaces into a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/df48ca0a35a0279763789907910ec4d1.poster.avif?t=1786921370\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/df48ca0a35a0279763789907910ec4d1.webm?t=1786921370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/df48ca0a35a0279763789907910ec4d1.mp4?t=1786921370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Limitless Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms: Emergency Exit features both <i><strong>infinite</strong></i><strong>  levels utilizing procedural generation</strong> while also having finite handcrafted levels aswell. As a result no playthrough will be like the one before. <strong>Each level has its own gameplay mechanics, entities, and mysteries.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/eb5f9d00c63f0c410f4c0ca327bdc983.poster.avif?t=1786921370\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/eb5f9d00c63f0c410f4c0ca327bdc983.webm?t=1786921370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/eb5f9d00c63f0c410f4c0ca327bdc983.mp4?t=1786921370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you escape?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to survive you will need to find supplies, solve puzzles and find ways to deal with all the entities that want you dead. Bring along your friends and hear their screams of terror echo across the Backrooms using proximity voice chat. Or make your way through the Backrooms on your own. The choice is yours.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Backrooms: Emergency Exit <strong>up to 4 players</strong> are trapped in the infamous Backrooms, based on the popular creepypasta. Traverse the levels of the Backrooms, each with their own set of secrets, quirks, and dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu