nd mysteries.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/eb5f9d00c63f0c410f4c0ca327bdc983.poster.avif?t=1786921370\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/eb5f9d00c63f0c410f4c0ca327bdc983.webm?t=1786921370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/extras/eb5f9d00c63f0c410f4c0ca327bdc983.mp4?t=1786921370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you escape?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to survive you will need to find supplies, solve puzzles and find ways to deal with all the entities that want you dead. Bring along your friends and hear their screams of terror echo across the Backrooms using proximity voice chat. Or make your way through the Backrooms on your own. The choice is yours.</p>", "short_description": "Backrooms: Emergency Exit is an Online-Coop Horror experience for 1–4 players. Survive in the face of horrifying entities and dangerous hazards. Uncover the mysteries and secrets hidden deep within the Backrooms to find the exit. And most importantly: Stay alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/2422e09184cd731e2b3c5925790e5cd457ba341d/header.jpg?t=1786921370", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/91eac766e5373497c2293c64ea8494af0c6053cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786921370", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026760/91eac766e5373497c2293c64ea8494af0c6053cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=178692